From: AzediZ <145237384+AzediZ@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 14:38:56 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 72/91] Wormholes: system effects from the phenomena

W-space systems with a secondary sun get the matching Effect Beacon for
their class (mapWormholeSystems.effectBeaconTypeID), spawned at the
secondary sun when the system boots. It is global, so it shows system
wide.

Ships in space there get the beacon's category 7 effects. They go on with
the hull's effects on login, boarding and pod, and are swapped on jump and
undock (old beacon's math undone, new one applied). Docking clears them
with everything else. Charges loaded in the system and drones/fighters
(Magnetar damage and speed) get them too.

Effects processor fixes this needed:
- AddLocationModifier on the ship now hits the fitted modules and charges
  that have the attribute, not the hull. This also makes Thermodynamics,
  the T3 subsystem and hull heat damage bonuses work.
- A multiplier on an attribute the item doesn't have uses the attribute's
  default instead of treating 0 as 1. Multipliers on 0 now stay 0 and come
  off cleanly (rocket damage types, smartbomb damage types).
- CurrentChar[skill] location modifiers from a non-skill source go on the
  pilot's items (Wolf-Rayet standard missile kinetic damage).
